    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Commonly nicknamed The Black Pearl, Atlantic Beach was shaped by the culture of the Gullah people from the Sea Islands.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atlantic_Beach%2C_South_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During the 1940s and 50s, prominent R&B singers performed at the Black Hawk Night Club in Atlantic Beach.",
