        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.townofatlanticbeachsc.com/page/about.history"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Entrepreneur George Tyson helped establish Atlantic Beach by purchasing beachfront property in Horry County in 1934.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        22
